<title>UK: Lloyd's investor raises 5.7mln stg in rights issue.</title>
<headline>Lloyd's investor raises 5.7mln stg in rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lloyd's of London corporate investor Advent Capital Plc said on Monday it has raised 5.7 million stg through a rights issue.</p>
<p>The funds will be used to acquire a 10 percent shareholding in Lloyd's managing agent B F Caudle and increase underwriting capacity on Caudle's non-marine insurance syndicate 780 to 7.5 million stg for the 1997 underwriting year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
